@startuml
title 浏览快照并恢复数据顺序图
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang SC
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam BorderColor #64748B
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #64748B
actor "桌面用户" as User
boundary "桌面 GUI" as UI
control "恢复协调器" as Restore
entity "备份仓库" as Repo
control "文本密钥文件服务" as KeyFile
control "解包 / 解密 / 解压" as Pipeline
control "冲突处理器" as Conflict
control "恢复校验服务" as Verify
entity "恢复目标文件系统" as Target
User -> UI : 打开仓库并浏览快照
UI -> Restore : 访问仓库
Restore -> Repo : 读取仓库头和格式版本
alt 仓库已加密
Restore --> UI : 请求密钥文件与口令
User -> UI : 选择文本密钥文件并输入口令
UI -> KeyFile : unlock(path, password, repositoryId)
alt 口令、文件和仓库标识有效
KeyFile --> Restore : 内存中的主密钥
else 错误口令、文件损坏或仓库不匹配
KeyFile --> UI : 明确失败且不返回密钥
end
else 仓库未加密
note over Restore,Repo : 跳过解锁
end
Restore -> Repo : 读取并认证快照清单
Repo --> UI : 快照与文件树
User -> UI : 选择内容、目标和默认冲突策略
UI -> Restore : restore(request)
loop 每个选定文件
Restore -> Target : 检查空间、权限和路径冲突
opt 目标路径已存在
Restore -> Conflict : 应用覆盖、跳过、重命名或询问策略
Conflict --> Restore : 逐项决定
end
Restore -> Repo : 按 ChunkReference 读取 pack 范围
Restore -> Pipeline : 解包 → 认证解密 → 解压
Pipeline -> Target : 写入临时文件
Restore -> Verify : 校验大小、哈希和必要元数据
alt 认证和校验成功
Verify -> Target : 原子放置并应用元数据
else 认证、解码或哈希校验失败
Verify -> Target : 删除临时文件并保留原文件
end
end
Restore --> UI : 恢复报告：成功、跳过、失败
@enduml
